# One-phrase review worksheet — Blackbird `[14,26.5)`

This is the smallest review packet for deciding whether the existing
source-only temporal preview is musically acceptable on one phrase. It is not
an implementation blocker: the preview can already be built without adding
harmonic pitches. The review supplies the semantic evidence needed for a
stronger musical claim.

