## Minimal annotation

For each attack position, mark the source IDs with one or more reviewer-owned
labels: `M` melody, `B` backing to preserve, `H` hook/identity event, `D`
decoration that may be dropped, `R` explicit rest/drop, or `U` unresolved.
Also record the reviewer and source of the decision; do not infer a semantic
role from the stored `L`/`R` hand field.

